SET S TO SHIP.
WAIT UNTIL ETA:APOAPSIS < 99.
S:PARTS[0]:GETMODULE("ModuleCommand"):DOACTION("toggle hibernation",FALSE).
LOCK STEERING TO PROGRADE.
WAIT UNTIL ETA:APOAPSIS < 4.
STAGE.
WAIT 20.
LOCK STEERING TO SUN:DIRECTION.
WAIT 60.
S:PARTS[0]:GETMODULE("ModuleCommand"):DOACTION("toggle hibernation",TRUE).